/S /H1
/T (Introduction Sexual violence remains one of the gravest human rights issues in India. Despite reforms in law and rising public awareness, the frequency of reported rape cases continues to alarm policymakers, law enforcement, and citizens alike. This project aims to perform a comprehensive SQL-based analysis of rape cases across all Indian states and union territories \(UTs\) from 2018 to 2022.)
/E (Introduction Sexual violence remains one of the gravest human rights issues in India. Despite reforms in law and rising public awareness, the frequency of reported rape cases continues to alarm policymakers, law enforcement, and citizens alike. This project aims to perform a comprehensive SQL-based analysis of rape cases across all Indian states and union territories \(UTs\) from 2018 to 2022.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
